      "hizbQuarter": 100,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1720,
      "text": "The thunder glorifies His praise, and so do the angels in awe of Him. He sends thunderbolts, striking therewith whom He wills, yet they dispute about Allah, Who is severe in might.",
